  What I built
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fb8dxwpl7g89yetdm6712.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fb8dxwpl7g89yetdm6712.png" alt=" " width="800" height="350"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fdhnaj7ivejfpuh9rkenj.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fdhnaj7ivejfpuh9rkenj.png" alt=" " width="800" height="267"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Current features:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X3DH-based session setup;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;symmetric ratchet with AES-GCM message encryption;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;encrypted per-device envelopes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;multi-device delivery;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;direct and group chats;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WebSocket/STOMP realtime messaging;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;typing indicators;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;online presence;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;read receipts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;message editing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;soft deletion;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;photo attachments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;phone OTP and email/password authentication;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JWT access/refresh tokens;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redis-based SMS rate limiting;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PostgreSQL + Flyway migrations;&lt;/li&gt;
