&lt;li&gt;encrypted media design;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;multi-device state synchronization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When we migrated our 1.2M MAU e-commerce platform from React 18 to &lt;a href="https://github.com/facebook/react" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;React 19&lt;/a&gt;, then ran parallel benchmarks against &lt;a href="https://github.com/vuejs/core" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Vue 3.5&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://github.com/angular/angular" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Angular 18&lt;/a&gt;, we saw a 40% aggregate improvement in Core Web Vitals (CWV) across LCP, FID, and CLS—with zero regression in feature velocity for our 14-person frontend team.&lt;/p&gt;

