&lt;a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;cloudflare.com&lt;/a&gt; English is fine, but German or Polish not so much 😭&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fl7o3tmdrb74jwooeovzv.png" alt="Cloudflare toolbar fitting in English" width="800" height="141"&gt; &lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fb940attbzqqfflwh1zmw.png" alt="Cloudflare toolbar getting tight in German" width="800" height="141"&gt; &lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fdyhlg76nvjo2wxmlmb0j.png" alt="Cloudflare toolbar getting tight in Polish" width="800" height="141"&gt;
