&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;a href="https://developers.openai.com/api/doc" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;OpenAI docs below 820px wide&lt;/a&gt; are not even dynamic, and still break 🤮&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fi7b3za6efuraocs9j0dk.png" alt="OpenAI docs navbar overflowing below 820px" width="800" height="62"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
